# GasKurir

**A native iOS app that helps LPG gas couriers record deliveries, track unreturned cylinders, and follow up on unpaid balances.**

GasKurir is built as an undergraduate final project (Informatics Engineering) by a developer who also works as a gas courier, so the problems it targets come from daily field work.

