## Overview

Gas couriers deliver filled cylinders to small shops and collect the empty ones. Most still keep records on paper or in memory, which leads to three recurring problems:

1. Deliveries are forgotten or recorded late.
2. Empty cylinders stay behind at shops and nobody notices.
3. Unpaid balances are hard to track across days and weeks.

GasKurir replaces manual bookkeeping with a fast, offline-capable app and puts the items that need action on the home screen.

